  "profile": "tabular-data-package",
  "name": "Orofacial-Myofunctional-Therapy-Obstructive-Sleep-Apnea",
  "title": "Orofacial Myofunctional Therapy Dataset for Obstructive Sleep Apnea",
  "description": "This dataset contains anonymised clinical and treatment-response data from 87 adult patients who underwent AI-assisted Orofacial Myofunctional Therapy (OMT) using the Smart Therapy Manager® system, aimed at treating Obstructive Sleep Apnea (OSA) and Primary Snoring (PS). The data are provided in CSV, XLSX, TTL, XML and JSON formats and are intended for clinical research, machine-learning, sleep-medicine and treatment-outcome analysis.",
